00:59:31,551 --> 00:59:34,363
- Lihatlah di sekitar kapal.
- Aku tidak bisa!

687
00:59:34,387 --> 00:59:37,157
- Kau bisa selamat. Aku akan mati!
- Aku tak bisa! Aku tak bisa!

688
00:59:37,181 --> 00:59:38,575
- Emma, kita tak punya waktu!
- Aku tak bisa melakukannya!

689
00:59:38,599 --> 00:59:39,785
Kita tak punya waktu!

690
00:59:39,809 --> 00:59:42,037
Apa, kau pikir mereka di sini
untuk bermain denganmu?

691
00:59:42,061 --> 00:59:45,040
Mereka akan membunuh kita!
Aku pendarahan di mana-mana!

692
00:59:45,064 --> 00:59:48,001
Lihat aku! Darah dia penuhi
seluruh kapal ini!

693
00:59:48,025 --> 00:59:50,337
- Tidak.
- Cepat buang dia ke laut!

694
00:59:50,361 --> 00:59:52,323
Buang dia ke laut!

695
00:59:53,407 --> 00:59:57,344
Emma, buang dia ke laut!

696
00:59:58,161 --> 01:00:00,889
- Maafkan aku... Maafkan aku.
- Masukkan dia ke air.

697
01:00:09,040 --> 01:00:10,549
Maafkan aku, Lani.

698
01:00:13,385 --> 01:00:15,070
Aku menyayangimu.

699
01:01:24,181 --> 01:01:26,891
Sekarang. Emma, sekarang. Ayo.

700
01:01:26,915 --> 01:01:28,851
Ayo, ayo!

701
01:01:31,296 --> 01:01:32,601
Ayo!

702
01:01:33,757 --> 01:01:35,126
Emma, ayo!

703
01:01:35,425 --> 01:01:38,254
Emma, ayo, berikan tanganmu.
Berikan tanganmu!

704
01:01:38,278 --> 01:01:40,381
Berikan tanganmu. Ayo. Cepatlah.

705
01:01:40,405 --> 01:01:42,240
Cepat, waktu kita tidak banyak!

706
01:01:42,682 --> 01:01:44,617
Emma, kapalnya tenggelam. Ayo.

707
01:01:44,893 --> 01:01:46,745
Kapalnya tenggelam. Naik ke rakit.

708
01:01:46,812 --> 01:01:48,226
Emma!

709
01:01:54,361 --> 01:01:55,624
Emma!

710
01:01:58,490 --> 01:01:59,803
Emma!

711
01:02:01,243 --> 01:02:02,501
Emma!

712
01:02:49,583 --> 01:02:50,984
Emma?

713
01:02:54,161 --> 01:02:55,467
Emma!

714
01:03:22,949 --> 01:03:25,009
Raih itu. Raih.

715
01:04:10,830 --> 01:04:12,413
Kami butuh...

716
01:04:16,002 --> 01:04:17,418
...bantuan.

717
01:04:20,465 --> 01:04:21,770
Kami butuh bantuan.

718
01:04:23,051 --> 01:04:24,386
Aku butuh bantuan.

719
01:04:25,553 --> 01:04:27,013
Siapa saja tolong kami.

720
01:05:10,473 --> 01:05:11,813
Mandal...

721
01:05:13,268 --> 01:05:14,478
Bangun.

722
01:05:17,897 --> 01:05:19,624
Aku mendengar percikan.

723
01:05:53,516 --> 01:05:55,259
Tidak...

724
01:05:55,285 --> 01:05:57,537
Mandal, tolong jangan tinggalkan aku.

725
01:05:58,229 --> 01:05:59,897
Tolong jangan tinggalkan aku.

726
01:06:03,109 --> 01:06:04,377
Tolong jangan tinggalkan aku.

727
01:06:04,401 --> 01:06:06,462
Kau janji akan tetap bersamaku.

728
01:06:06,486 --> 01:06:07,947
Mata hijau.

729
01:06:10,325 --> 01:06:11,968
Itu artinya keberuntungan.

730
01:06:15,038 --> 01:06:16,514
Bantuan akan datang.

731
01:06:20,794 --> 01:06:22,671
Mereka akan menemukanmu.

732
01:06:24,339 --> 01:06:25,757
Kau akan baik saja.

733
01:06:27,175 --> 01:06:29,027
Aku tak bisa melakukan ini sendirian.

734
01:06:29,052 --> 01:06:30,845
Tolong tetap bersamaku.

735
01:06:33,264 --> 01:06:34,891
Tolong tetap bersamaku.

736
01:06:44,192 --> 01:06:45,668
Mandal!

737
01:06:46,903 --> 01:06:48,034
Tolong...

738
01:06:48,738 --> 01:06:50,615
Tolong jangan pergi.

739
01:06:52,575 --> 01:06:55,161
Mandal, kembali!

740
01:07:00,625 --> 01:07:02,418
Tolong jangan pergi.

741
01:07:05,004 --> 01:07:06,631
Mandal!

742
01:07:07,841 --> 01:07:09,590
Mandal!

743
01:07:12,887 --> 01:07:14,280
Mandal!

744
01:07:14,806 --> 01:07:16,433
Mandal!

745
01:07:27,152 --> 01:07:28,612
Mandal?

746
01:07:32,031 --> 01:07:33,449
Mandal?

747
01:07:39,747 --> 01:07:41,540
Mandal?

748
01:08:49,426 --> 01:08:50,793
Tolong!

749
01:08:52,695 --> 01:08:53,868
Tolong!

750
01:10:54,505 --> 01:10:56,986
Tolong. Aku butuh bantuan.

751
01:10:59,781 --> 01:11:03,259
Aku terdampar.
Aku melihat kapal.

752
01:11:06,079 --> 01:11:07,664
Aku butuh bantuan!

753
01:11:24,504 --> 01:11:25,531
<i>Halo?</i>

754
01:11:28,935 --> 01:11:31,287
Aku tak bisa Bahasa Tailan.

755
01:11:31,312 --> 01:11:34,148
Tolong, berputar kembali.

756
01:11:37,276 --> 01:11:38,511
<i>Halo?</i>

757
01:11:44,325 --> 01:11:47,303
Tolong berputar kembali, tolong.

758
01:11:47,370 --> 01:11:49,222
Aku melihat kapal.

759
01:11:49,247 --> 01:11:50,480
<i>Halo?</i>

760
01:17:09,316 --> 01:17:11,043
Aku tak mau melukai kalian!

761
01:17:11,527 --> 01:17:13,045
Aku mohon...

762
01:17:16,741 --> 01:17:18,451
Aku tidak membunuh dia!

763
01:18:06,373 --> 01:18:07,916
Itu benar.

764
01:18:09,502 --> 01:18:11,145
Kau memaksaku melakukannya!

765
01:18:12,254 --> 01:18:13,672
Kau yang melakukan itu!

766
01:18:19,845 --> 01:18:21,321
Untuk Lani.

767
01:18:42,034 --> 01:18:43,744
Tolong!